<title>HONG KONG: Hyundai Int'l Merchant Bank sets US$70 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Int'l Merchant Bank sets US$70 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Credit Lyonnais Hong Kong.</p>
<p>BORROWER  HYUNDAI INTERNATIONAL MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$70 MLN   COUPON    6ML+50 BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCH    25.SEPT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES   11.OCT. 96</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS   NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH    PAY DATE  OCT 96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS  US$5 MLN+  48 BP   ALL-IN 66 BP</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGERS   US$3-4 MLN 42 BP   ALL-IN 64 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS BANKGESELLSHAFT BERLIN GROUP (EUROPEAN BOOKRUNNER),</p>
<p>	     CREDIT LYONNAIS HONG KONG (ASIAN BOOKRUNNER), CS</p>
<p>	     FIRST BOSTON HONG KONG, DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL,</p>
<p>	     HANIL BANK AND DEVELOPMENT BANK OF SINGAPORE.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-4039</p>
</text>
